{
  "id": "dewarim-textures",
  "title": "Dewarim: Textures",
  "description": "Seamless top-down textures for painting scenes - stone walls and rock, dirt floors, water and lava - and the 148 named web colours as flat tiles, for blocking a map out quickly. Rendered with POV-Ray from the scene files in the module, so any of them can be recoloured and rebuilt. System-agnostic.",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "authors": [
